note [System Library Demonstration in E++ (.enppl)]
add the "System" library

note [1. Inspecting Platform and OS]
say "Operating System:", the os
say "Architecture Platform:", the platform

note [2. Executing shell commands and capturing stdout]
run system command "whoami" and save the output as 'User'
say "Running as system user:", 'User'

run system command "uname -r" and save the output as 'Kernel'
say "Operating system kernel:", 'Kernel'
